I settled on these autopickup_exceptions a while ago:

# name anything !! to always autopickup, or == to never do so
# these combos picked because they're quick to type and easy to
remember
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION="<*!!*"
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*==*"

# leave cursed stuff
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">* cursed*"

# gems are in pickup_types, with these exceptions
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*rock*"               # no rocks
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION="<*luckstone*"       # all known luckstones
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION="<*touchstone*"     # all known touchstones
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*loadstone*"       # no known loadstones
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*gray stone*"      # no un-IDed gray stones
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*flint*"                # no known flint stones
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*worthless*"      # no known worthless glass

# tools are in pickup_types, with these exceptions
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*chest*"  # no chests or boxes
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*box*"
AUTOPICKUP_EXCEPTION=">*pick*"    # no pick-axes (or broad picks)



